[{"label":"An article page","html":"<article id=\"site-article\" data-i18n-component style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; width: 100%\">\n  <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n    <select\n      class=\"select\"\n      data-size=\"sm\"\n      data-app-locale\n      aria-label=\"Language\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Language\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Sprache\"\n      style=\"width: auto\"\n    >\n      <option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option>\n      <option value=\"de\" lang=\"de\">Deutsch</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <header class=\"mk-article-header\">\n    <a class=\"mk-article-header-category\" href=\"#\">Engineering</a>\n    <h1 class=\"mk-article-header-title\">How offline sync works in Acme 4.0</h1>\n    <p class=\"mk-article-header-subtitle\">CRDTs, a write-ahead log and a lot of patience.</p>\n    <div class=\"mk-article-header-byline\">\n      <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n      <div>\n        <a class=\"mk-article-header-author\" href=\"#\">Sophie Tan</a>\n        <div class=\"mk-article-header-meta\"\n          ><time datetime=\"2026-10-01\" data-article-date\n            ><span data-i18n-target=\"date\"><span data-i18n-value=\"date\">1 October 2026</span></span></time\n          ><span data-i18n-target=\"read\"><span data-i18n-value=\"minutes\">8</span> min read</span></div\n        >\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"mk-article-header-media\">\n      <img src=\"images/mk-wide.png\" alt=\"A whiteboard sketch of the sync pipeline\" />\n      <figcaption>The first sketch of the sync pipeline, March 2026.</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </header>\n  <div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 42rem; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: 1.25rem; box-sizing: border-box\">\n    <div\n      class=\"mk-share-links\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-label=\"Share this article\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Share this article\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Diesen Artikel teilen\"\n    >\n      <span class=\"mk-share-links-label\" data-i18n-target=\"share\">Share</span>\n      <ul class=\"mk-share-links-list\">\n        <li\n          ><a\n            class=\"btn\"\n            data-variant=\"outline\"\n            data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n            href=\"https://x.com/intent/post?url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fcalm-software&amp;text=Calm%20software\"\n            target=\"_blank\"\n            rel=\"noopener\"\n            aria-label=\"Share on X\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Share on X\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Auf X teilen\"\n            ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path\n                d=\"M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22h-6.3l-4.9-6.4L6.4 22H3.3l7.3-8.3L.8 2h6.4l4.4 5.9L18.9 2Zm-1.1 18h1.7L6.3 3.9H4.5L17.8 20Z\"\n              /></svg></a\n        ></li>\n        <li\n          ><a\n            class=\"btn\"\n            data-variant=\"outline\"\n            data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n            href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fcalm-software\"\n            target=\"_blank\"\n            rel=\"noopener\"\n            aria-label=\"Share on LinkedIn\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Share on LinkedIn\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Auf LinkedIn teilen\"\n            ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path\n                d=\"M5 3.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 5 8.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 3.5ZM3 10h4v11H3V10Zm7 0h3.8v1.6h.1c.5-1 1.8-1.9 3.6-1.9 3.9 0 4.5 2.5 4.5 5.8V21h-4v-4.9c0-1.2 0-2.7-1.7-2.7s-2 1.3-2 2.6v5h-4V10Z\"\n              /></svg></a\n        ></li>\n        <li\n          ><a\n            class=\"btn\"\n            data-variant=\"outline\"\n            data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n            href=\"mailto:?subject=Calm%20software&amp;body=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fcalm-software\"\n            aria-label=\"Share by email\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Share by email\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Per E-Mail teilen\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"mail\"></i></a\n        ></li>\n        <li\n          ><button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"btn\"\n            data-variant=\"outline\"\n            data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n            data-share=\"copy\"\n            aria-label=\"Copy link\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Copy link\"\n            data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Link kopieren\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"link\"></i></button\n        ></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mk-article-body\" data-article-body>\n    <p\n      >Sync is the feature nobody notices until it fails. Our goal for 4.0 was simple to state and hard to build:\n      <strong>never lose a keystroke</strong>, online or off.</p\n    >\n    <h2>Why CRDTs</h2>\n    <p\n      >A conflict-free replicated data type lets two devices edit the same document without a server deciding who wins.\n      Every operation <a href=\"#\">commutes</a> - merging becomes a set union.</p\n    >\n    <blockquote><p>The best sync is the one you forget is there.</p><cite>Hannah Lee, Design</cite></blockquote>\n  </div>\n  <div\n    style=\"\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 2rem;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 42rem;\n      margin-inline: auto;\n      padding-inline: 1.25rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    \"\n  >\n    <section class=\"mk-author-bio\" aria-labelledby=\"article-bio\">\n      <span class=\"avatar\" data-size=\"lg\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n      <div class=\"mk-author-bio-body\">\n        <span class=\"mk-author-bio-label\" data-i18n-target=\"written\">Written by</span>\n        <h2 class=\"mk-author-bio-name\" id=\"article-bio\"><a href=\"#\">Sophie Tan</a></h2>\n        <p class=\"mk-author-bio-role\" data-i18n-target=\"bio-role\">Staff engineer, Sync team</p>\n        <p class=\"mk-author-bio-text\"\n          >Sophie leads the sync team at Acme. Before that she built storage engines at two databases you have heard of.\n          She writes about distributed systems, testing, and calm engineering.</p\n        >\n        <ul class=\"mk-author-bio-links\">\n          <li\n            ><a\n              class=\"btn\"\n              data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n              href=\"#\"\n              rel=\"me\"\n              aria-label=\"Website\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Website\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Website\"\n              ><i data-lucide=\"globe\"></i></a\n          ></li>\n          <li\n            ><a\n              class=\"btn\"\n              data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n              href=\"#\"\n              rel=\"me\"\n              aria-label=\"Email Sophie\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Email Sophie\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Sophie eine E-Mail schreiben\"\n              ><i data-lucide=\"mail\"></i></a\n          ></li>\n          <li\n            ><a\n              class=\"btn\"\n              data-variant=\"ghost\"\n              data-size=\"icon-sm\"\n              href=\"#\"\n              aria-label=\"RSS feed of Sophie's posts\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"RSS feed of Sophie's posts\"\n              data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"RSS-Feed von Sophies Beiträgen\"\n              ><i data-lucide=\"rss\"></i></a\n          ></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <nav\n      class=\"mk-article-nav\"\n      aria-label=\"More articles\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"More articles\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Weitere Artikel\"\n    >\n      <a class=\"mk-article-nav-link\" href=\"#/articles/designing-for-calm\" data-router-link rel=\"prev\">\n        <span class=\"mk-article-nav-dir\"\n          ><i data-lucide=\"arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <span data-i18n-target=\"prev\">Previous</span></span\n        >\n        <span class=\"mk-article-nav-title\">Designing for calm</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"mk-article-nav-link\" href=\"#/articles/testing-sync\" data-router-link rel=\"next\">\n        <span class=\"mk-article-nav-dir\"\n          ><span data-i18n-target=\"next\">Next</span> <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i\n        ></span>\n        <span class=\"mk-article-nav-title\">Testing sync with a lossy network</span>\n      </a>\n    </nav>\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"read-next\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem\">\n      <h2 id=\"read-next\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.125rem\" data-i18n-target=\"read-next\">Read next</h2>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem\">\n        <article class=\"mk-related-item\" data-variant=\"card\">\n          <figure class=\"mk-related-item-media\"><img src=\"images/mk-wide2.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure>\n          <div class=\"mk-related-item-body\">\n            <span class=\"mk-related-item-kind\" data-i18n-target=\"kind-article\">Article</span>\n            <h3 class=\"mk-related-item-title\"\n              ><a href=\"#/articles/designing-for-calm\" data-router-link>Designing for calm</a></h3\n            >\n            <p class=\"mk-related-item-meta\" data-i18n-target=\"meta-calm\">24 Sep 2026 · 5 min read</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"mk-related-item\" data-variant=\"card\">\n          <figure class=\"mk-related-item-media\"><img src=\"images/mk-square.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure>\n          <div class=\"mk-related-item-body\">\n            <span class=\"mk-related-item-kind\" data-i18n-target=\"kind-guide\">Guide</span>\n            <h3 class=\"mk-related-item-title\"\n              ><a href=\"#/articles/testing-sync\" dat